# Allowlist: only what the image build needs enters the build context, so
# .git, .env, data/, .venv, node_modules, caches and local builds never do.
*
!pyproject.toml
!uv.lock
!README.md
!src/
!web/

# Excluded again inside the allowed directories.
**/__pycache__
**/*.py[cod]
**/.DS_Store
web/node_modules
web/dist
web/.vite
web/coverage
